                    <li><a name="n2"></a>See &ldquo;Were 364 Economists All Wrong?&rdquo; BBC Newsnight  report by Stephanie Flanders, <a href="http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/programmes/newsnight/4803858.stm">http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/programmes/newsnight/4803858.stm</a>. </li>
                    <li><a name="n3"></a>See &ldquo;Three Cheers for  Irving,&rdquo; by David Brooks, <em>New York Times</em>,  Sept. 22, 2009. </li>
